WEBVTT

00:23.690 --> 00:25.817
I bid good morning

00:26.317 --> 00:28.695
to the Twelve Bishops.

00:30.071 --> 00:35.076
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince So I Can
Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability Season 2)

00:36.244 --> 00:40.290
This is a special day where
we celebrate the birth of God.

00:40.832 --> 00:43.584
Let's make this festival a success.

00:43.585 --> 00:46.504
Certainly. It is a shame
about the weather, though.

00:48.089 --> 00:50.091
That would be my fault.

00:50.592 --> 00:53.427
Rain tends to follow me.

00:53.428 --> 00:56.847
The ceremonial parade will be canceled.

00:56.848 --> 00:59.100
The rest will go as discussed earlier.

00:59.768 --> 01:03.854
You will all be split up
to visit the various churches,

01:03.855 --> 01:07.316
all while under our protection.

01:07.317 --> 01:10.986
Hold it! Why must we
be set apart from the Pope?!

01:10.987 --> 01:15.992
I'm sure Albert is doing this
for our safety.

01:16.534 --> 01:22.956
Since the culprit who attacked the
Daen Cathedral seems to hate the church,

01:22.957 --> 01:28.253
it'd be easier to protect us in smaller
groups than having us in one place.

01:28.254 --> 01:29.255
Indeed.

01:31.090 --> 01:34.260
<i>Well, not like
we can't tell them the truth,</i>

01:34.803 --> 01:39.140
<i>that we're watching out
for a monster hiding among them.</i>

01:40.141 --> 01:41.809
Rest assured,

01:41.810 --> 01:45.522
we will do our utmost
to keep each of you safe.

01:45.980 --> 01:51.026
Now then, your guards
will take you to each church.

01:51.027 --> 01:53.238
Please, enter the carriages.

01:54.447 --> 01:57.325
Let us depart, Your Holiness.

02:02.330 --> 02:06.042
I will be your guard, Bishop Anastasia.

02:07.460 --> 02:09.462
I will be counting on you.

02:14.801 --> 02:16.469
They're pissing me off.

02:17.470 --> 02:22.725
Who needs protection? If there's
any idiot trying to ambush me...

02:23.601 --> 02:27.856
...I will beat 'em up and personally
deliver them to the Gods myself.

02:31.609 --> 02:37.364
Batts, a man doesn't run off their mouth.
They talk with their back.

02:37.365 --> 02:41.243
The heck are you talking about, Dante?
My mouth isn't on my back.

02:41.244 --> 02:43.453
This is why I called you stupid.

02:43.454 --> 02:46.039
What?! The heck you just said?!

02:46.040 --> 02:47.374
- Excuse me...
- Say it again!

02:47.375 --> 02:50.879
- Bishop Dante, please come with me...
- Hey, say something, will you!

02:52.755 --> 02:55.425
Dante, I'm not done talking!

02:57.051 --> 02:59.136
We're heading the other way.

02:59.137 --> 03:02.639
Let me go, hag!
I'm not done talking to Dante!

03:02.640 --> 03:04.182
Geez, you're strong!

03:04.183 --> 03:06.352
He's under your care.

03:09.355 --> 03:12.358
Great, a very unsociable guy.

03:13.109 --> 03:16.069
Which one of them am I going to protect?

03:16.070 --> 03:19.156
Please let it be a hottie,
please let it be a hottie!

03:19.157 --> 03:20.783
Isn't it him?

03:25.413 --> 03:29.917
Not yet! I have one more guy to protect!
He's definitely going to be a hottie!

03:29.918 --> 03:31.502
He should be the other guy.

03:36.174 --> 03:37.257
Follow me please...

03:37.258 --> 03:39.635
What's with that lack of motivation?!

03:39.636 --> 03:41.262
Do your job properly!

03:41.888 --> 03:43.181
You must be the one.

03:45.183 --> 03:50.520
You're the victim of the intruder
in priest clothing in Daen Cathedral, yes?

03:50.521 --> 03:51.647
Yes...

03:51.648 --> 03:56.568
And you people believed that man
is involved with the church, huh?

03:56.569 --> 03:58.028
You hoodlums!

03:58.029 --> 04:01.782
Just what are you planning
with such mockery?!

04:01.783 --> 04:04.660
Now now, calm down, Thor.

04:04.661 --> 04:07.829
So, you have any idea
who exactly the culprit is?

04:07.830 --> 04:09.999
No, not yet...

04:11.251 --> 04:15.296
If you really wanted to protect us, we
should be traveling as one group instead.

04:18.299 --> 04:21.551
I will escort the two priests!

04:21.552 --> 04:25.306
Hold it right there!
What are you carrying right there?!

04:25.682 --> 04:28.810
A drink to celebrate an important job.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.312
Would you like to have some?

04:33.064 --> 04:35.857
As if! You really think
you can guard us like this?!

04:35.858 --> 04:37.318
We're so sorry!

04:44.826 --> 04:51.791
(Episode 19: The Great Advent Festival)

04:55.253 --> 04:56.336
Father.

04:56.337 --> 04:59.631
The Pope will arrive shortly.

04:59.632 --> 05:02.843
It has been a while
since I last saw Guitane.

05:02.844 --> 05:05.095
You've known him
for a long time, haven't you?

05:05.096 --> 05:11.060
Yes, from even before I was king
and he was the pope.

05:12.186 --> 05:16.606
<i>If the mysterious priest
was indeed one of the bishops,</i>

05:16.607 --> 05:22.363
<i>then the Pope's assassination should've
been prevented by separating them.</i>

05:23.156 --> 05:25.783
<i>I just hope everything will go smoothly.</i>

05:28.119 --> 05:30.496
The Pope's carriage has arrived.

05:34.459 --> 05:36.753
It has been a while, Your Holiness.

05:37.378 --> 05:40.005
Please forgive us for all the trouble.

05:40.006 --> 05:42.007
Oh, Albert!

05:42.008 --> 05:44.218
How you've grown.

05:45.553 --> 05:48.638
- Guitane!
- Charles!

05:48.639 --> 05:54.352
I heard you were coming,
so I adjusted my schedule just for you!

05:54.353 --> 05:58.149
Oh please, I'm sure you just want
to hear your daughter's performance.

05:59.192 --> 06:02.235
You got me.
Saria is just so adorable.

06:02.236 --> 06:04.446
Sometimes she gets
my name wrong, though.

06:04.447 --> 06:07.115
<i>- Chang!
- It's Papa Charles!</i>

06:07.116 --> 06:10.160
Huh?! I think
you should correct her there!

06:10.161 --> 06:14.081
And there's one more thing
I'm looking forward to today.

06:14.082 --> 06:17.794
- What is that?
- Please, can you continue inside?

06:18.753 --> 06:23.298
<i>I can't help but be worried.
The security here is just so sparse.</i>

06:23.299 --> 06:28.053
<i>It is forbidden to carry weapons
during the Advent Festival, after all.</i>

06:28.054 --> 06:31.808
<i>Maybe I could say that
it's safer that way, but still...</i>

06:34.060 --> 06:37.188
We believe he can change
his appearance at will,

06:37.939 --> 06:40.441
so that sketch
might not be very helpful.

06:41.359 --> 06:43.027
Do you know who he could be?

06:44.987 --> 06:46.280
No.

06:46.864 --> 06:49.032
Rather, it's improbable.

06:49.033 --> 06:54.288
I understand the situation,
but it's too late to cancel the festival.

06:55.289 --> 06:58.835
The full investigation has to wait
until after the festival.

07:01.295 --> 07:05.508
You may manage the security
as you see fit.

07:07.718 --> 07:11.681
<i>We will be counting on you.</i>

07:13.433 --> 07:14.683
<i>Please...</i>

07:14.684 --> 07:18.688
<i>May this joyous occasion stay this way!</i>

07:19.480 --> 07:22.692
<i>Everyone, please return home safely!</i>

07:23.860 --> 07:27.446
W-Was there a cutie like her
in this church?

07:27.447 --> 07:30.240
Yeah. Is that one of the sisters?

07:30.241 --> 07:33.243
She has to be. She came here
with Bishop Anastasia!

07:33.244 --> 07:35.288
Really?

07:36.205 --> 07:39.292
You seem to be even
more popular than I am.

07:40.501 --> 07:44.964
Would you consider quitting your job
as a maid and joining the church?

07:47.800 --> 07:50.136
<i>Bishop Anastasia...</i>

07:50.678 --> 07:54.474
<i>If you are the mysterious priest
or their accomplice,</i>

07:55.266 --> 07:57.602
<i>then it would be the worst-case scenario.</i>

07:58.561 --> 08:00.812
My outfit?

08:00.813 --> 08:05.108
Yes, if you are to accompany me
for the day,

08:05.109 --> 08:08.279
then I'd like you to dress
more appropriately.

08:08.946 --> 08:13.618
I understand.
Can you lend me a uniform from the church?

08:16.704 --> 08:21.125
You may be my guard, but please
don't bring this kind of thing.

08:22.001 --> 08:25.505
I shall prepare a shorter dress for you.

08:27.465 --> 08:29.926
<i>She is as strong as they say.</i>

08:30.468 --> 08:32.636
<i>And the closest person to the Pope.</i>

08:32.637 --> 08:35.723
<i>The woman closest to the Pope.</i>

08:36.349 --> 08:38.391
<i>I can only pray for the best.</i>

08:38.392 --> 08:42.395
<i>Pray that she is not the enemy.</i>

08:42.396 --> 08:47.401
<i>Goodness, still so fierce
even without a sword.</i>

08:48.402 --> 08:53.907
<i>The other guards watch two bishops each,
but she watches only me.</i>

08:53.908 --> 08:57.452
<i>Not to mention,
it's the Silver Blader herself.</i>

08:57.453 --> 09:00.414
<i>Because of that,
I cannot do as I please.</i>

09:01.666 --> 09:05.670
<i>There's also a crow that stays
above the church despite the rain.</i>

09:06.337 --> 09:09.506
<i>However, none of them matters.</i>

09:09.507 --> 09:14.720
<i>You people should've prepared for
the absolute definite worst-case scenario.</i>

09:21.310 --> 09:24.313
- Oh?
- It seems like they're starting.

09:25.314 --> 09:28.191
I didn't expect this level
of performance for a church!

09:28.192 --> 09:30.319
Is that a bass drum?

10:02.184 --> 10:04.645
What? What is happening?!

10:05.396 --> 10:06.564
Guards!

10:07.189 --> 10:08.607
What's going on?!

10:08.608 --> 10:10.192
Everyone, please stay calm!

10:12.612 --> 10:14.155
What is happening outside?

10:15.323 --> 10:21.078
It's the sound of the gates
of hell opening, Charles.

10:21.954 --> 10:27.418
I've reserved the best seat
for this grand event just for you.

10:31.505 --> 10:34.091
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince So I Can
Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability Season 2)

10:49.565 --> 10:51.858
Apologies for calling at a difficult time.

10:51.859 --> 10:58.240
But we still believe that you are
the most qualified to be our new Pope.

11:01.202 --> 11:04.288
We ask you to take the ritual,

11:05.498 --> 11:06.624
Guitane.

11:09.502 --> 11:14.881
We will proceed to cast
the Luma Maxima on you.

11:14.882 --> 11:19.261
If your heart remains unchanged
after receiving it,

11:19.804 --> 11:23.974
then you are without a doubt righteous,
worthy to be the Pope.

11:25.017 --> 11:26.519
Luma Maxima.

11:37.405 --> 11:40.657
There is no doubt in my soul.

11:40.658 --> 11:44.412
I have nothing to repent.

11:47.039 --> 11:50.708
Incredible! What an incredible person!

11:50.709 --> 11:53.504
He didn't show even a slight change!

11:54.713 --> 11:57.799
He doesn't have even
a sliver of malice in his heart!

11:57.800 --> 12:00.803
Even after the tragedy he had to suffer!

12:06.142 --> 12:07.351
<i>No.</i>

12:09.186 --> 12:13.065
<i>At this point, I was certain.</i>

12:13.649 --> 12:17.902
<i>This dark, wicked thing
that grew inside me</i>

12:17.903 --> 12:22.158
<i>has surpassed
even the Gods' perception of "Evil."</i>

12:22.950 --> 12:27.621
<i>A deep darkness
that no light can reach through.</i>

12:29.707 --> 12:34.086
I have no doubt
of my new belief, of the abyss.

12:36.964 --> 12:40.843
It's getting louder out there, Charles.

12:41.802 --> 12:47.348
I had planned for chimeras to emerge
from under this church as well,

12:47.349 --> 12:50.853
but unfortunately,
Albert managed to demolish the lab.

12:52.188 --> 12:54.939
But no matter,

12:54.940 --> 12:58.359
my forces will become a tidal wave...

12:58.360 --> 13:01.489
- What is this hole?
- It opened out of nowhere...

13:01.989 --> 13:06.577
...And swallow this nation whole.

13:07.912 --> 13:10.831
Run! Monsters!

13:14.793 --> 13:16.003
<i>What a disaster!</i>

13:16.587 --> 13:18.881
<i>We protected the enemy all along!</i>

13:19.882 --> 13:23.385
<i>The one we should've protected
was my Father!</i>

13:24.011 --> 13:26.804
You too, Albert.

13:26.805 --> 13:29.600
Everyone who seeks
to enact Charles' will...

13:31.268 --> 13:35.022
Or rather, God's will,
will be erased.

13:35.523 --> 13:40.027
The laws of this nation are based
on the Gods' teachings.

13:40.569 --> 13:44.155
"Do not kill." "Do not lie."
"Do not steal."

13:44.156 --> 13:47.785
Teachings that are
seemingly common sense.

13:48.702 --> 13:51.162
But it's all wrong.

13:51.163 --> 13:55.543
There is nothing wrong with murder,
or with stealing.

13:56.252 --> 13:58.295
As long as you remain pure...

13:59.880 --> 14:01.256
Guitane!

14:01.257 --> 14:05.302
Your voice...
This must be our first meeting in person,

14:06.095 --> 14:07.930
Angel Jihriel.

14:08.597 --> 14:11.517
Even after everything I did,
your master...

14:12.476 --> 14:15.563
The Gods still refuse
to descend upon Earth, I see.

14:16.230 --> 14:21.317
I hoped they would arrive
after all the mess I've made.

14:21.318 --> 14:23.528
What changed you?

14:23.529 --> 14:26.823
Depending on your answer,
I might have to judge you myself!

14:26.824 --> 14:32.579
<i>Is he one of the sacred envoys
who grant Divine Sorcery to people?</i>

14:32.580 --> 14:34.456
- What?!
- Your Holiness?!

14:34.832 --> 14:37.208
<i>With an angel,
we might be able to stop him!</i>

14:37.209 --> 14:38.543
<i>He's only one man.</i>

14:38.544 --> 14:41.839
<i>We must stop him before
he harms Father or the crowd!</i>

14:45.384 --> 14:47.970
I am not obligated to answer you.

14:48.971 --> 14:50.347
Oh no!

14:51.432 --> 14:54.059
- What is that?!
- Your Majesty!

14:55.227 --> 14:57.604
The Pope... is a monster?!

14:57.605 --> 14:58.980
Someone call the guards!

14:58.981 --> 15:05.236
When I saw that sketch,
I was reminded of your younger look.

15:05.237 --> 15:07.197
Or rather,

15:07.740 --> 15:13.244
that was how your child would've
looked, had he been alive.

15:13.245 --> 15:17.999
So you've changed since back then...

15:18.000 --> 15:20.001
Charles.

15:20.002 --> 15:23.756
Are you fine with those
being your final words?

15:24.673 --> 15:26.008
Father!

15:26.550 --> 15:28.344
Your Majesty!

15:30.804 --> 15:34.140
Sacred envoy, forget about me...

15:34.141 --> 15:36.893
Please save Albert!

15:36.894 --> 15:43.608
And tell my two children that I am sorry
I could not see their recital!

15:43.609 --> 15:47.988
Envoy! Forget about me!
Save Father! Save him!

15:49.740 --> 15:54.535
Worry not, every member of the
royal family will be sent to heaven.

15:54.536 --> 15:58.623
You will be able to hear your children's
performance up there.

15:58.624 --> 16:00.793
Save Father!

16:01.293 --> 16:04.797
<i>Wait, two children...?</i>

16:11.929 --> 16:15.975
You see, I left Paradise
without permission.

16:17.685 --> 16:22.189
This is my master on Earth!

16:42.960 --> 16:46.380
Now that I think about it,
it did start when we passed by each other.

16:50.801 --> 16:55.430
The boy who appeared
behind me without warning.

16:55.431 --> 16:59.225
It made me uneasy.
A grave oversight.

16:59.226 --> 17:02.353
I could not have wished
for a more fortunate mistake.

17:02.354 --> 17:06.357
As a human,
I couldn't reach the heavens.

17:06.358 --> 17:10.278
That's why I started
this rebellion against God

17:10.279 --> 17:12.822
by destroying this nation, this faith.

17:12.823 --> 17:16.659
But also, I had a slight hope that
by bringing this nation to ruin,

17:16.660 --> 17:20.955
the Gods would arrive to serve

17:20.956 --> 17:24.376
their judgment upon me.

17:30.716 --> 17:31.966
Thank you.

17:31.967 --> 17:35.846
By killing you, my descent
into the abyss will be complete.

17:38.640 --> 17:44.645
Your presence filled me with such hope,
and you even command an angel.

17:44.646 --> 17:47.649
What could you be, if not a God?

17:49.068 --> 17:50.652
I'm just a prince.

17:51.612 --> 17:52.863
The seventh prince.

17:54.364 --> 17:56.158
Whoa, what the?!

18:01.038 --> 18:05.083
Father?! Al?!
Where did you come from?!

18:05.084 --> 18:07.752
Dian?! Is this the Saloum Castle?!

18:07.753 --> 18:09.921
What just happened?

18:09.922 --> 18:12.465
That should be my line!

18:12.466 --> 18:15.426
There's an uproar in town.
Is it connected to this?

18:15.427 --> 18:18.430
That's right, Dian! I need your help!

18:20.265 --> 18:21.433
Father...

18:23.143 --> 18:26.313
Our enemy can freely
change their appearance.

18:27.106 --> 18:31.527
In other words, that one must be
an impostor disguised as the Pope!

18:32.319 --> 18:33.362
No...

18:36.365 --> 18:38.199
You're right.

18:38.200 --> 18:41.452
That has to be an impostor.

18:41.453 --> 18:44.455
Order all the guards in the palace!

18:44.456 --> 18:47.458
Our foe is at the cathedral in Daen!

18:47.459 --> 18:50.963
Protect the people at all costs!

18:54.508 --> 18:57.218
<i>Now that he's in front of me,
it has become clear...</i>

18:57.219 --> 19:00.347
<i>Actually, no.
It's even more confusing...</i>

19:01.306 --> 19:05.101
<i>He's compressing his mana
and controlling his mana channels,</i>

19:05.102 --> 19:08.187
<i>he's burning through
an outrageous amount of mana</i>

19:08.188 --> 19:11.108
<i>every second to hide his true powers.</i>

19:12.109 --> 19:16.237
<i>He's good at hiding, like myself.</i>

19:16.238 --> 19:20.241
Master Lloyd!
Escher and Saria are both safe!

19:20.242 --> 19:21.285
Okay.

19:21.994 --> 19:24.705
You two go help out in town.

19:25.247 --> 19:28.666
There are more chimeras let loose
in the city than I expected.

19:28.667 --> 19:31.837
I might have my hands full with him.

19:32.337 --> 19:36.966
Wait! I have a reason to face him!
Please, let me handle this!

19:36.967 --> 19:38.886
You can't beat him.

19:40.387 --> 19:42.264
<i>He's that strong, huh?</i>

19:43.682 --> 19:46.017
A bit late, but can't you
use your Mana Senses

19:46.018 --> 19:48.895
to teleport straight
to where the mysterious priest is?

19:48.896 --> 19:51.273
Well, I only passed by him once.

19:51.940 --> 19:54.901
Not to mention his mana
was weirdly faint.

19:54.902 --> 19:59.573
Now that I think about it, he must be
hiding his powers, just like me.

20:00.282 --> 20:04.076
<i>He's right. This guy
is holding back his mana.</i>

20:04.077 --> 20:08.039
<i>He might be at a demon level...
Or even a demon lord!</i>

20:08.040 --> 20:10.166
I refuse.

20:10.167 --> 20:13.544
If I leave, I bet you'll go
"Let's try it myself!"

20:13.545 --> 20:16.297
- and walk right into his attacks!
- Will not!

20:16.298 --> 20:18.174
- Do you mean that?!
- I do!

20:18.175 --> 20:19.927
Keep your word, okay?

20:24.348 --> 20:25.515
Let's go, Jihriel!

20:28.977 --> 20:31.438
Unholy Excalibur.

20:35.234 --> 20:38.862
Jihriel, I won't let you esca...

20:51.792 --> 20:55.045
Mana Focus, Impulsa Incinis.

21:18.443 --> 21:19.987
Divinity Septuple.

21:48.098 --> 21:49.141
Guitane.

21:50.142 --> 21:53.894
I wanted to talk
about so many things with you.

21:53.895 --> 21:58.734
But before that,
I have to tell you one thing.

22:07.534 --> 22:09.202
You've made a big mess.

23:51.805 --> 23:53.931
<i>The rain always follows me,</i>

23:53.932 --> 23:58.894
<i>but no matter how much it rains,
it can never wash away my caged heart.</i>

23:58.895 --> 24:01.021
<i>Next on episode 20:</i>

24:01.022 --> 24:02.398
<i>Invasion.</i>

24:02.399 --> 24:05.819
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>
